#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:1 ad5e89a4a53349ee870d74619370c81f
msgid "Multi-asset / portfolio backtests"
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:3 f77352144dbb4ecd819af3a120f3d919
msgid ""
"QTrade supports portfolio backtests where a single strategy trades "
"multiple assets sharing one cash pool. The single-asset workflow from "
"[Getting Started](getting_started.md) is unchanged — multi-asset is "
"enabled by passing a dict of DataFrames instead of a single one."
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:8 507cfb07caf0466ba9d21ce59a9a69b0
msgid "Data"
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:10 15447882b0cd4f499a40daac238cb323
msgid ""
"Pass a `dict[str, pd.DataFrame]` keyed by asset symbol. Every DataFrame "
"needs the standard OHLCV columns and **must share an identical "
"`DatetimeIndex`** (align/reindex up-front if your sources don't):"
msgstr ""

#: ../guide/multi_asset.md:31 11d4b118ce48472b889c5469ae5d6848
msgid ""
"`Backtest` validates each DataFrame independently and raises a clear "
"error if the indexes diverge."
msgstr ""

